  <item>
    <title>vol.010_人人都爱玲娜贝儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66456c79251bd96e6ca6d2d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66456c79251bd96e6ca6d2d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 02:16:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🧸“终于理解为什么有那么多人喜欢Jellycat/玲娜贝儿/chiikawa/棉花娃娃/Labubu/养芒狗/…了” ——来自冲浪体验</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;早在在没有入坑任何IP时就已经加入了豆瓣「戒断Jellycat互助小组」，这个小组打着互助戒断服务的旗号疯狂分享晒娃，组内的「成瘾区」「戒断失败区」更是热闹非凡。从来没见过实体娃的我也常常感慨：这些被赋予五官四肢的瓜果蔬菜毛绒玩偶怎么会这么可爱！</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在更多人意识到”情绪价值“重要性的当下，越来越多的IP走到我们面前。主播迪迪跟伊伊也有了自己的本命IP，也有了”终于理解为什么有那么多人喜欢___“的时刻。无关商业，无关营销，只谈喜爱～</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;期待大家跟我们一起分享！</span></p><h2><span>🎯时间轴</span></h2><p><strong><em><span>一入迪圈深似海——迪士尼管管你家达菲</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 深圳的出租屋里容纳不下一只玩偶，除非它是星黛露</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 迪士尼七宝诞生不是横空出世，是达菲E熊爱交友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> 探险家玲娜贝儿闪闪惹人爱火出圈，内胆粉也有助力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 情绪价值也来源付出，出门也要给家里星黛露开抽湿机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 你们迪圈有自己的期货市场</span></p><p><strong><em><span>有机物IP来了——南京红山森林动物园</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 长大后再也不忍心逛动物园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> 红山大象粪便卖脱销，全园动物齐帮忙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">34:02</a> 全国最好的公立动物园里，动物们有不被看到的权利</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a> 当你爱上动物后，很难不注意到红山动物园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2422">40:22</a> 扬子鳄趴趴入手初体验之《我真的不是变态》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 打起来了！我们中国有自己的迪士尼</span></p><p><strong><em><span>对自己好可以有一百种方式</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3264">54:24</a> 养酵母菌老面团芒狗，也是我的电子布洛芬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3529">58:49</a> 重新把自己养一次，拒绝性别刻板印象，全面接纳自己</span></p><p></p><h2><span>🎞️提及作品</span></h2><p><strong><span>《逛动物园是件正经事》</span></strong><span>花蚀，中国动物学会会员，果壳网前新媒体主编。这是一本关于动物园、关于动物福利、关于人和动物关系、关于如何观看动物的书，通过“中国 动物园巡礼”过程对场景进行拆分和讲解，可以知道“什么样的动物园是好动物园”，进而学会“如何参观动物园”。是的，逛动物园是件费脑的正经事！</span></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XAJ4c6badhBTvpqjKqK9hg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XAJ4c6badhBTvpqjKqK9hg"><strong><span>《孤独矗立的动物园｜谷雨》</span></strong></a></p><p></p><h2><span>🎬节目制作</span></h2><p><span>主播：悦悦&amp;迪迪&amp;伊伊</span></p><p><span>脚本：伊伊</span></p><p><span>制作/脚本/剪辑/文案/视觉：迪迪</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llK2j8JZYDpSwYJWOOIPArBaSzd5.m4a" length="104146273" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqkkGPHSME--2sz5rSejtYKg5evs.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.009_亲身体验洗脑培训的千层套路：v我3600你还得谢谢我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d85fac0bef6c20743cd32e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d85fac0bef6c20743cd32e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Feb 2024 09:04:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>😱悦悦在不知情的情况下参加了top级零售企业主办的“魔鬼训练营”，亲身体验了</span><strong><span>洗脑培训的千层套路</span></strong><span>。体力与精神经历双重折磨濒临崩溃，大病一场后让她来讲一讲自己经历了什么，为什么这样的“洗脑培训”还存在，为什么不能中途退出，这样的“培训”真的合法么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎯时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;迪迪和伊伊最费解的事情：悦悦一个金融从业者为什么会被公司要求只身前往参加“魔鬼训练营”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“黄埔训练营二期”这名字听着是用来过审的吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;培训中让人觉得“反人类”的地方</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;体罚：640个俯卧撑，蒙眼棍棒打后背</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;打压：永远别想在他们的规则中做赢家</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1187">19:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;煽情：利用亲情友情道德绑架操控情绪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;洗脑：强调团队意识，口号动作整齐划一</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;为什么没有人中途退出：给我3600块你还得谢谢我</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><span>天下攘攘。皆为利往。</span></em></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><em><span>天下熙熙。皆为利来。</span></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">35:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;悦悦没有被洗脑成功的法宝：违背个人价值观，找到规则漏洞，保持独立思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;洗脑培训到底给悦悦带来了什么，积分么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我们还见过哪些带有“洗脑”特征的事件：入职培训，豫章书院，电击疗法<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2994">49:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;如何甄别洗脑培训的套路：</span><strong><span>警惕满足这9条套路的活动</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❗️迪迪在深圳遇到了pua训练班学员搭讪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎞️制作</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：悦悦&amp;迪迪&amp;伊伊</span></p><span></span><p><span>脚本/剪辑/文案/视觉：迪迪</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：The World's Wanderer - Mermaid</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrZ1u4aVjwuwsLAV7yPVESwKNAO-.m4a" length="84217069" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtQldRVjItTVFXREFqeUlfcFB2Zmgxc0QtTUoucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.008_五月天假唱如何激怒纯路人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6590eb45b8fd2bc06043ca3c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6590eb45b8fd2bc06043ca3c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Dec 2023 04:17:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>👀一句</span><strong><span>“祺贵人告发熹贵妃私通”</span></strong><span>把五月天事件带到了我们面前</span></p><p><span>是什么让纯路人的我们特意出一期节目来聊「五月天假唱」风波？不是为了论证是否假唱，也不是要伸张正义。是因为我们在最近的公众人物事件中感受到了一种上位者对普通消费者的轻视</span></p><p><span>可以感觉到我们在讨论时也很小心翼翼，而截止到节目发出这一天，五月天事件仍然没有定论…</span></p><p><strong><span>🎯时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;吃瓜没吃全的可以来听听：从“祺贵人告发熹贵妃私通”来捋一捋五月天事件全过程</span></p><p><strong><span>我们以纯路人视角对彼此发出灵魂拷问：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;你们认为五月天假唱了吗：达成一致✋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;假唱这件事本身有错吗：非常难认定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;五月天团队在黄金公关时间中到底做了什么：摆烂式公关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;假唱底线在哪里：付费为王</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;五月天为什么不能主动承认假唱：百害无一利</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;风波中我们看到的粉丝行为：大致分为四个类型</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;局外人看粉丝沉迷其中这个现象：不能带入但可以理解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;还有什么公众人物行为是你让你不能接受的？</span></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;违法违反道德行为：陈建州起诉大牙诽谤败诉</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">53:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;公众人物歧视行为：杨丞琳地域歧视事件</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3448">57:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;暴露素质、吃相难看、业务能力差等其他行为</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>🎞️制作介绍</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>伊伊：娱乐圈纯路人</span></p></li><li><p><span>悦悦：对娱乐圈容忍度极高</span></p></li><li><p><span>迪迪：一个大写的河南人</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>脚本：</span></strong><span>伊伊</span></p><p><strong><span>剪辑：</span></strong><span>悦悦/迪迪</span></p><p><strong><span>文案：</span></strong><span>迪迪</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsk4eeRFBvijQauSrIuwGxnxAelY.m4a" length="90720873" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZyUTAzOU5MWjFQbGNXOURlTE43T05qVDBsWmkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.007_南北过冬大不同｜深漂的我们有话说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6569b2729f440f5443e6d1c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6569b2729f440f5443e6d1c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Dec 2023 10:16:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>❄️ 又到了</span><strong><span>「冬季南北方孰冷？」</span></strong><span>战火再起的季节，你支持哪一边呢？</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;三位主播分别从</span><strong><span>四川</span></strong><span>（北纬31°）、</span><strong><span>河南</span></strong><span>（北纬35°）、</span><strong><span>黑龙江</span></strong><span>（北纬47°）来到</span><strong><span>深圳</span></strong><span>（北纬22.5°）工作，同时也有在欧洲国家</span><strong><span>白俄罗斯</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>英国</span></strong><span>读书的经历。可谓是从北方到南方，从西半球到东半球全面覆盖。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;于是我们围绕着</span><strong><span>「这些地方的冬天到底是什么样子的？南方何时能集中供暖？中国最适宜过冬的城市在哪？」</span></strong><span>等问题展开了讨论，来跟我们一起过冬吧！欢迎大家一起来分享你家乡的冬天～</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><h2><span>🎯</span><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;刚从北京飞回深圳的伊伊同学，太热到太冷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;黑龙江悦一边嘲笑我们过度保暖，一边在26℃的夜晚通宵开电热毯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;小时候在家乡冬天到底是怎么熬过来的？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;川H版：谣言电热毯有辐射，紧紧抱住热水袋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;黑H版：大棉袄二棉裤，里头是羊皮外头裹着布</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;豫G版：布衾多年冷似铁，冻疮年年长在身</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">27:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;南方该不该集中供暖？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>从历史看：集中供暖是社会主义目标之一，新中国成立之初百废待兴划定了秦岭淮河以北为集中供暖区域延续至今</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>从发展看：2000年后才展开大规模集中供暖建设，前北方城镇集中供热率也只有七成左右</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>从现状看：南方对集中供暖的呼声越来越高，尤其长江沿线一带</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我国候鸟式养老冬季栖息地适宜城市排名（图1）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;城市养老服务分级：看了价格连夜撸铁锻炼身体</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">39:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;海南置产的亲戚们：冬季带长辈来晒太阳</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">43:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;迪迪悦悦在欧洲求学时的冬天</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2647">44:07</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;白俄罗斯：战斗民族深冬裸奔成习俗（图2），冬季漫长抑郁自杀屡见不鲜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国：穿短裤</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;窝冬神器推荐（图3）：猫咪（bushi</span></p><span></span><h2><span>📃内容相关资料</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>图1：候鸟式养老冬季栖息地适宜城市排名</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiYYLZKakIGIOj4qjhcUcx_ajD-6.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>图2：明斯克参加“男人节”选手合影</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhPjipn136kS2VN1kwZA7jMLJqAE.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>图3：窝冬神器推荐（无带货）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjf3zc9owiYvJqkIiTILiJ867kYl.png"></figure><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>👪主播介绍</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgsK4czhG2-32g4YTCdNFjweeyf_.png"></figure><span></span><p><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnffNzyKCvGMBGZv51pnQsIaiV0I.m4a" length="82591303" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZyUTAzOU5MWjFQbGNXOURlTE43T05qVDBsWmkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
